  "Tatsuro": "",
  "N Senryo Ave.": "",
  "Yukko": "",
  "Inbox": "",
  "Outbox": "",
  "Yagami-kun, thanks to you I have more confidence in my cooking! Now I'll have no problem opening up my izakaya.": "",
  "(Oh, it's a message from Tomioka-san.)": "",
  "...That's what I'd like to say, but I have all sorts of preparations to do, so it might take a while.": "",
  "It'll happen sometime in the not-too-distant future.": "",
  "But for now, I'll continue to enjoy cooking with your advice in mind. I'll be sure to make you more goodies on occasion.": "",
  "Well then. Looks like I'll be seeing you around!": "",
  "Glad I could be of service!": "",
  "Thank you for the meal!": "",
  "I'll get you that rent as soon as humanly possible.": "",
  "Oh no, it was my pleasure!": "",
  "Thank you! I look forward to seeing you complete your big, important case. Then you can pay me all the rent you owe! <symbol=message_heart1>": "",
  "Thanks again for cooking! Can't wait to see that izakaya of yours.": "",
  "Don't mention it! Oh, but it'll be a little longer till I can pay my rent...": "",
  "Alright alright, enough with that already. But don't take too long, okay?": "",
  "(Guess that about wraps it up. I'm glad I was able to pay my dues, even if all I did was eat.)": "",
  "(Though what I really should be paying is my rent...)": "",
  "Sorry to bug, Yagami-shi, but I kinda need to ask\na small favor.": "",
  "Just think of it as paying me back for last time.": "",
  "Fair enough. What do you need me to do?": "",
  "Buy me a model figure. There's a specific one I've been looking for, and apparently they have it at Ebisu...": "",
  "Which makes sense, since they're limited-edition and sold out everywhere else. This may be my only chance to get it!": "",
  "All right. I'll see what I can do.": "",
  "They're having technical difficulties with the plane, so I'm off the hook! Heading back now.": "",
  "Sorry about earlier, Mafuyu. I was... undercover and I said some things I shouldn't have.": "",
  "Oh, I'm sorry. I should have known better. I hope I didn't mess anything up for you.": "",
  "Help! I've been kidnapped by a stalker": "",
  "Do you know where you are?": "",
  "Car, tied up in trunk": "",
  "(Hm. Tied up in a trunk? Not good.)": "",
  "How are you contacting me? Your cell?": "",
  "Threw cell away. Watch.": "",
  "(Her smart watch! That means she can move her fingers, at least.)": "",
  "Can you call the police?": "",
  "He'll know. Don't know where I am. Emailed friend to call cops": "",
  "So the police are on it... But if they're not fast enough...": "",
  "Is there anything that would give you a location?": "",
  "Can you tell me the model, shape, or color of the car?": "",
  "Black, square, big": "",
  "A van?": "",
  "Where were you kidnapped?": "",
  "Battery dying!": "",
  "Damn! What other details should I get from her?": "",
  "Do you know which direction the car came when you were kidnapped or which way it went after?": "",
  "Came from Senryo, went south": "",
  "Do you know how many turns the car took after you were kidnapped?": "",
  "I think 5": "",
  "Car hasn't moved": "",
  "Then... It might have not left Kamurocho yet.": "",
  "Have you heard any distinct sounds around you?": "",
  "Loud place, now quiet": "",
  "Ramen": "",
  "Ramen?": "",
  "Smell ramen after car stopped": "",
  "A ramen store on a quiet street... I think that's enough to go on.": "",
  "Battery dying": "",
  "Crap.": "",
  "Model or car color?": "",
  "Direction the car went?": "",
  "How many times the car turned?": "",
  "Do you know where you were kidnapped?": "",
  "Nearby sounds?": "",
  "Ohata": "",
  "Yagami-san, thanks for this. I'll forward you the picture I got from Ayumu.": "",
  "(Where is this?)": "",
  "(I should check out anywhere that looks similar, I guess. Couldn't hurt to ask people who might've seen him, too.)": "",
  "Yagami-san, this is the picture Ayumu sent me. Thank you again!": "",
  "Image from Ayumu: Location Not Available": "",
  "(It's high up again, but what's that in the middle?)": "",
  "(I guess it's back on the trail.)": "",
  "Yagami-san, here's another photo from Ayumu. Please find him.": "",
  "(Looks like an interior, this time. At least he's not somewhere high up...)": "",
  "(There's a Wild Jackson nearby. At least that's helpful!)": "",
  "Well, it's got a... unique flavor.": "",
  "Would you mind chopping up the ingredients a bit more?": "",
  "Perhaps you can do without the bitter melon?": "",
  "You haven't tasted it yourself, have you...": "",
  "So I tried your curry, Tomioka-san.": "",
  "It's certainly got a unique flavor. I bet there are people out there who would really enjoy it.": "",
  "However, you might want to aim for something a little more universal.": "",
  "Curry is pretty popular, so I imagine some people might be taken aback if the flavor's too off from their expectations.": "",
  "The carrots and potatoes weren't chopped that well.": "",
  "I'd say focus on chopping up the ingredients first. Also, I personally prefer something with a more recognizable flavor.": "",
  "The spiciness of the curry and the bitterness of the melon... well, let's just say they don't compliment each other.": "",
  "If you're aiming for delicious, perhaps you can do without the latter?": "",
  "I prefer a more normal-flavored curry.": "",
  "Um... have you tasted it for yourself?": "",
  "'Cause the curry and the bitter melon did not work together. It's like the flavors were fighting in my mouth.": "",
  "I personally prefer a more normal-tasting curry.": "",
  "(All right, that should do.)": "",
  "It's almost there.": "",
  "I mean, I like the idea of it.": "",
  "The wasabi's all over the place.": "",
  "Have you... tried it yourself?": "",
  "Tomioka-san, I tried your chicken karaage.": "",
  "It's almost there. I think you're on the right track, just be sure to apply the wasabi more evenly next time.": "",
  "The parts that did have the right amount of wasabi were delicious, though.": "",
  "Also, I would recommend tasting your food first before serving it to someone else. Just a thought.": "",
  "I think the idea itself is great. Wasabi chicken karaage has an appeal like no other fried appetizer before it.": "",
  "However, the execution of said karaage needs some work. Please apply the wasabi evenly so it's not inconsistent.": "",
  "Please try a taste the next time you cook. I'm begging you.": "",
  "...And it honestly needs some work. For starters, you should apply the wasabi evenly so it's not inconsistent.": "",
  "Um... have you tried it for yourself? The wasabi was all over the place. Each piece was either bland or deadly.": "",
  "(Okay, that should just about do it.)": "",
  "Delicious!": "",
  "Tomioka-san, I tried your okonomiyaki.": "",
  "And it was seriously the best I ever had! All it needed was a nice, cold beer on the side, haha.": "",
  "Please keep 'em coming, Tomioka-san! You're doing great!": "",
  "(Awesome. That about wraps it up.)": "",
  "(Man, I'm exhausted. Maybe I should call up that masseuse... 3,000 yen an hour's not bad.)": "",
  "Request a massage.": "",
  "Never mind.": "",
  "(Nah, I probably shouldn't. Still seems kinda sketch.)": "",
  "Hey, could I get a massage sometime?": "",
  "(Whoops. Don't have enough on me.)": "",
  "The name's Takayuki Yagami. Could you come to the Yagami Detective Agency in Nakamichi Alley?": "",
  "Sure! I'll be right over then!": "",
  "You betcha! Just gimme your name and address and I'm there!": "",
  "(Man, I'm exhausted. Maybe I should get a massage... It's only 3,000 yen an hour, and that's a special price.)": "",
  "(Maybe not right now... One more needle in my skin and I might not make it to tomorrow.)": "",
  "Sure! Same thing, same place?": "",
  "Awesome! Then I'll be on my way!": "",
  "Yeah, Yagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "(Now's not such a good time.)": "",
  "Feel free to call me again later, though!": "",
  "Sorry, but I'm busy with another client right now. Plus I'm all the way over in the Hotel District.": "",
  "(Guess someone else got to her first. But of all places, the Hotel District...? Something seems off here.)": "",
  "(Man, I'm exhausted. Maybe I should get a massage... After all, it's 1,500 yen an hour, and that's just for me.)": "",
  "(Hmm, what to do...)": "",
  "Got it! You just kick back and relax, and I'll have ya better in no time!": "",
  "Jo Masuda": "",
  "This is the guy. His name is Junichi Fujinaga.": "",
  "Wait a sec!": "",
  "Don't get the wrong idea. A friend of mine has a little thing going at a beauty salon.": "",
  "You knew I was following you?": "",
  "Yeah. I figured you would, and the odds were in my favor.": "",
  "Yagami-san, this is Sana Mihama <symbol=message_joy1>\nThank you so much for the other day!\nYou really cheered me up, you know.": "",
  "I'll cheer you up anytime.": "",
  "Just doing my job.": "",
  "...Who is this again?": "",
  "I'll cheer you up anytime, Sana-chan. The show must go on!": "",
  "Hehe, then I won't let you down!\nHope you'll come hear me sing again soon!": "",
  "That's not a very nice way to put it <symbol=message_sad1>\nYou would help me even if wasn't work-related... right?": "",
  "Geez, you really have an awful sense of humor.\nBut I know you'd help me out if it ever came to that.": "",
  "Well, don't forget, you are my client. It's what I do, remember?": "",
  "If I was in a good mood, maybe.": "",
  "Anyway. I hope you'll come by and hear me sing the next time you're free.": "",
  "Sure, I'll be there.": "",
  "Um, who was this again?": "",
  "Hey! <symbol=message_angry1><symbol=message_angry1><symbol=message_angry1><symbol=message_angry1>": "",
  "Hahaha. My bad. I was just messing with you.": "",
  "Well I don't appreciate being \"messed with\" so don't ever do that again! <symbol=message_angry1>": "",
  "Won't happen again, promise.\nAnyhow, I'll always be rooting for you, Sana-chan.": "",
  "Good! And thank you. I hope you'll come hear me sing again the next time you're free!": "",
  "Um, if it's not too much trouble... can I ask you something?": "",
  "Is there any chance we can meet up? I'd like to thank you for the other day. (*^_^*)": "",
  "I wanted to see you too.": "",
  "Sure. I'm pretty much always available.": "",
  "Yay! Where should I meet you, then?": "",
  "How does Theater Square sound? It's kinda by Kamuro Theater.": "",
  "Cool, can't wait! <symbol=message_joy1>": "",
  "Sounds good. I actually wanted to see you too.": ""
 },
